{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's picnic time! Help Pinguino the penguin push tasty treats onto the picnic blanket in this delightful Sokoban-inspired game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482240/extras/pp_steam_gif4.gif?t=1740688978\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push multiple blocks at once and rearrange them to clear paths and complete challenging levels. Explore various worlds filled with a wide variety of wacky enemies and puzzles to solve.<br> <br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482240/extras/food_1.png?t=1740688978\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482240/extras/picnic_top_features.png?t=1740688978\" /> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Simple and addictive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Clever puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple skins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charming 16-bit aesthetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awesome music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482240/extras/picnic_bottom.png?t=1740688978\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482240/extras/food_2.png?t=1740688978\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482240?t=1740688978","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482240?t=1740688978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482240/2948536666f41ce83e48e87383e367dfce9e23ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740688978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482240/2948536666f41ce83e